  "body": "This PR adds PA configuration for LR2021 based on lookup table. It has been optimized the same way as SX126x series has been, measurement logs are available in https://github.com/radiolib-org/power-tests\r\n\r\nSo far only Sub-GHz PA has been measured, hence this is still in draft. Because the LR2021 does not seem to have a fixed default (like the SX126x did), this optimization will always be enabled.\r\n\r\nWe also need to figure out a simple mechanism to allow users to provide their own PA configuration table.\r\n\r\nFixes #1740\r\n",
